{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And Moav was terrified.</b> The chiefs of Moav — for Israel had not been permitted to pass through their land, as Jephthah testified, saying (Judges 11:17): ״וְגַם אֶל אֶרֶץ מוֹאָב שָׁלַח וְלֹא אָבָה״." "<b>That it was great.</b> Not because of the strategy of their warfare." "<b>And Moav felt loathing.</b> The multitude of Moav loathed their lives because of the Israelites who were despoiling them."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:37.380299527Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}